{"name":"On the Rocks","hex":"#d0cec8","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"on the rocks","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Prepositional phrase","definitions":["Poured over ice, usually in reference to alcoholic drinks.","In a bad state; experiencing difficulties or at risk of failing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/on_the_rocks"}],"entries":[{"title":"On the Rocks (2008 play)","blocks":[{"text":"On the Rocks is a 2008 play written by Amy Rosenthal and directed by Clare Lizzimore about real events surrounding novelist, short story writer, poet and playwright D. H. Lawrence in the tiny village of Zennor in Cornwall in 1916 in the middle of World War I. It played at the Hampstead Theatre in London from 1 to 26 July 2008. It was shortlisted for the Susan Smith Blackburn Prize in 2009."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_the_Rocks_(2008_play)"},{"title":"On the Rocks (film)","blocks":[{"text":"On the Rocks is a 2020 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Sofia Coppola. It follows a father and daughter as they harbor suspicions about her husband's fidelity. It had its world premiere at the New York Film Festival on September 22, 2020. It received a limited theatrical release on October 2, 2020, by A24, followed by digital streaming on October 23, 2020, by Apple TV+. It received positive reviews from critics, who noted it as lighter than Coppola's previous films, and praised Murray's performance."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/44/On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_the_Rocks_(film)"},{"title":"Bartending terminology","blocks":[{"text":"Various unique terms are used in bartending."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg/330px-15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bartending_terminology"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/44/On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg/250px-On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/44/On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/44/On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg/250px-On_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOn_the_Rocks_poster.jpeg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg/500px-15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg/1280px-15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg/500px-15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A martini served straight up with an olive","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg/500px-Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg/1280px-Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg/500px-Negroni_served_in_Vancouver_BC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=p